From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@invalid>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 23:22:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] backends/monitor: Expose configured and effective targets
 over DisplayConfig

Validate target properties by presence and type before configuration mutation, with replacement/reset semantics. Report effective RGBW/luminance and individual provenance from the applied color device, using its shared source table. Add deferred API regressions for VERIFY, invalid input, persistent rejection/restore and a 400-nit user target at scaled reference white. Selector integration and unit execution are deferred to the full reviewed candidate.
---
